  ('t','India is still pushing into Asia.',True,'About five centimetres a year.'),
  ('m','The only active volcano in India is on','Barren Island','Lakshadweep','Sundarbans','It is in the Andaman and Nicobar Islands.'),
  ('m','The Peninsular Plateau tilts towards the','east','west','north','So big rivers flow east.'),
